# Testing

## Run

- `perl t/test_<name>.pl` (TAP via Test::More)
- Stubs: `t/stubs.pl` — keep `%text` complete for validate_* tests
- Lib tests calling CGI-only subs: add empty stubs to `stubs.pl`

## Gotchas

- `CORE::GLOBAL` mocks in `BEGIN { }`, not `local *` after require
- STDERR capture: `File::Temp` + `open(STDERR, '>&', $fh)`, not `open(STDERR, '>>', \$scalar)`
- `\Q...\E` sparingly in tests — breaks path regex when over-applied
- Job tests: `$_jobs_home_base = $fake_home`, not real `/home`
- `module_config_bootstrap_standalone`: test with fake `WEBMIN_CONFIG` + `miniserv.conf`, not production paths
- Network skips: use `SKIP: { skip ..., 1 unless ... }` at top level — not `skip` inside `subtest` (breaks Test::More plan)
- Precedence: `ref($x) ne 'HASH'` not `!ref($x) eq 'HASH'`

## Minecraft / modpack regression

After modpack/mod/API changes:

- `t/test_mc_modpack.pl`, `t/test_mc_mods.pl`, `t/test_module_config.pl`

## Critical regression

Must pass after security/provisioning changes:

- `t/test_security_guards.pl`
- `t/test_provisioning_flow.pl`
